      "message": "We should finalize a plan for a VTS test for this before submitting.\n\nOnce this is in, even if people don\u0027t implement it in a VM, they can implement it on device. Ideally we can have a VTS test in Android that would run against binder services or TEE services serving the same instance.\n\nThough, I\u0027m not sure if we can get such a nice thing, if we can\u0027t get that, could we add a normal VTS test here which asserts that this interface is not implemented via binder, because we don\u0027t have test coverage for that?",
