      "message": "Yeah, that VTS test should cover the VINTF case.\n\nWe need to align on how to get a VTS test that is portable and such, but I think we should be able to merge this interface, for use in trunk*. Please not, having a fully defined and tested vendor interface is the bar for releasing this HAL. We cannot commit to such APIs and support them without a well-defined interface. It puts too much cost on the Android upgrade process. Thank you!",
